      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 7.0."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Autoclave and cool down to room temperature while flushing with N2. Then add the following solutions from sterile anaerobic stocks:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "First dissolve EDTA・2Na and adjust pH to 8.0 with KOH. Then add theminerals."
    }
